--   **Context.** A lines, table set-up, part 10: the native set-up program
--
--   `natUp Zn oN`: move the descriptor `Zn → 54 → 31`, run the core (`J6AILTab9`), move the table
--   `43 → 41`, distribute with B5's `distAll oN`, move the descriptor back `31 → 54 → Zn`.
--   **`natUp_sp`**: from the descriptor alone on `Zn` to the `A` register file `kerV …` on `oN`,
--   for any layout with `oN i < 31` or `= 55` (injective) and `Zn ∈ {49, 55}`, `Zn ∉ range oN`
--   (the layout of B5's `nativeLayout`).
